Package: idlescreen
Version: 2.5.0-1
Architecture: all
Depends: idle-daemon, idle-cli, idle-savers, idle-tui
Recommends: idle-cosmic
Maintainer: IdleScreen <jerydleuck@gmail.com>
Description: IdleScreen product metapackage for Wayland screensavers
 Installs the modular host stack: idle-daemon, idle-cli, idle-savers, idle-tui.
 On COSMIC Desktop, install idle-cosmic as well (or use install.sh which detects DE).
 .
 Install:  sudo dnf install idlescreen   /   sudo apt install idlescreen
 Remove:   sudo dnf remove idlescreen    /   sudo apt remove idlescreen
